text.en:
The following barrios are hereby created in the Municipality of Capul, Province of Samar:
(1) Barrio of Uson, consisting of the sitios of Lungib, Pahot, Suriyawan, Muyac and Catandocolan;
(2) Barrio of Diraya, consisting of the sitios of Danao, Minanga, Bocason, Camayao-payawan and Dalairo;
(3) Barrio of Jubang, consisting of the sitios of Londres, Boquid, Mapapak, Catandocolan and Sagaosawan.
